      `the votes present at the meeting and entitled to vote on the election of the director` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 204(d)(4)b. the ratification of the election of the director carries by a majority of the votes present` `the votes in favor of ratifying the election of the director` `the votes present at the meeting and entitled to vote on the election of the director` MEANS
    `the vote carries`
        (`a majority of` `the shares present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote`)
        `the votes in favor of ratifying the election of the director`
        `the votes present at the meeting and entitled to vote on the election of the director`

-- The whole approval: quorum, the vote (b.'s majority for a director, otherwise the type's own vote), the larger
-- earlier requirement if there was one, and the s 203 vote if s 203 was breached. NOTHING when the director vote's
-- counts cannot be a vote.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 204(d)(4) (src:691-694)
GIVEN facts IS A `s 204(d)(4) Approval facts`
      `the director vote carries` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 204(d)(4) the stockholders approved the ratification` facts `the director vote carries` MEANS
    CONSIDER (IF facts's `the defective corporate act is the election of a director`
              THEN `the director vote carries`
              ELSE JUST (facts's `the vote required for this type of act when the ratification is approved was obtained`))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST voted THEN
        JUST (    facts's `the quorum required for this type of act when the ratification is approved was present`
              AND voted
              AND (   (NOT facts's `the instruments in effect at the time of the defective corporate act required a larger quorum or vote`)
                   OR facts's `that larger quorum and vote were obtained, leaving out shares of a class or series with no shares outstanding and any person no longer a stockholder`)
              AND (   (NOT facts's `the failure of authorization resulted from a failure to comply with s 203`)
                   OR facts's `the vote set forth in s 203(a)(3) was obtained`))

