    IF `the instrument is a certificate attached to a certificate of validation`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `s 204(f) What ratification does from the validation effective time`

-- "From and after the validation effective time": a comparison of days. Later day: yes. Earlier day: no. The same day
-- cannot be told apart from before or after without the time of day: NOTHING (fork F-T).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 204(f) (src:710)
GIVEN `the day in question` IS A DATE
      `the day of the validation effective time` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 204(f) the day is from and after the validation effective time` `the day in question` `the day of the validation effective time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day in question` GREATER THAN `the day of the validation effective time` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the day in question` LESS THAN `the day of the validation effective time` THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

