    `was a holder of record of valid stock or putative stock as of the time of the defective corporate act`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the holder's identity and address can be determined from the records of the corporation`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the holder approved the action by consent in lieu of a meeting under s 228`                                              IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: s 228 (piece dg5)
    `the holder holds putative stock and otherwise consented to the action in writing`                                        IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 204(g) (src:713)
