    OR (    holder's `was a holder of record of valid stock or putative stock as of the time of the defective corporate act`
        AND holder's `the holder's identity and address can be determined from the records of the corporation`)

-- No notice is required (i) if notice of the ratification is to be given under subsection (d); and where the notice is
