        (   `the notice contains a copy of the resolutions adopted pursuant to subsection (b)`
         OR `the notice contains the information specified in paragraphs (b)(1)(A) through (E) or (b)(2)(A) through (C), as applicable`)
    AND `the notice contains the statement that a claim must be brought within 120 days from the later of the validation effective time and the time this notice is given`

-- Has the corporation done what the subsection requires for this holder? Nothing is owed to a holder who is not owed the
-- notice; a holder who is owed it is covered if the notice is deemed given, or if it was given promptly with the required
-- contents. "Prompt" has no figure in the text: it is a fact the person states (fork F-P).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 204(g) (src:713)
