      `the notice may be deemed given` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holder was given notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice was given promptly` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice contains what the subsection requires` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
